WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.472 --> 00:00:16.976
"Ahh!" Roxy flew straight up.

2
00:00:17.677 --> 00:00:21.218
Crash! Below her, the cars smashed into each other.

3
00:00:21.238 --> 00:00:23.958
"You think you're fast, huh?"

4
00:00:24.539 --> 00:00:25.819
Magda snapped her fingers.

5
00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:28.660
A washing machine shot toward Roxy.

6
00:00:32.124 --> 00:00:33.905
Pow! Roxy punched it.

7
00:00:34.626 --> 00:00:36.807
The washing machine flew back down at Magda.

8
00:00:37.608 --> 00:00:39.029
Magda pretended to be scared.

9
00:00:39.049 --> 00:00:40.670
"Oh no!

10
00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:43.372
I hope I don't get hurt!"

11
00:00:43.952 --> 00:00:44.873
Then she laughed.

12
00:00:47.955 --> 00:00:49.136
Magda held up her hand.

13
00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.818
The washing machine slowed down and stopped.

14
00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:54.340
She smiled as it floated in the air.

15
00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:57.962
When she dropped her hand, the appliance landed in front of her.

16
00:00:57.982 --> 00:01:00.444
"Wow," Roxy thought.

17
00:01:02.048 --> 00:01:03.449
"How does she A shadow passed over her.

18
00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:06.710
Roxy looked up as a huge truck shot down.

19
00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:10.952
"Yikes!" Roxy zoomed up and grabbed the truck.

20
00:01:13.553 --> 00:01:15.574
Magda threw a car on top of the truck.

21
00:01:16.754 --> 00:01:17.775
Then she threw another.

22
00:01:23.377 --> 00:01:25.578
Roxy's arms shook from the tremendous weight.

23
00:01:26.678 --> 00:01:30.580
"Yawn. This is so easy," Magda said.

24
00:01:31.212 --> 00:01:34.255
"I thought a battle with you would be more challenging."

25
00:01:34.275 --> 00:01:40.100
"Grr!" Roxy used her super strength and tossed the pile of cars away.

26
00:01:40.961 --> 00:01:44.203
Crash! They landed on top of some rusty old cars.

27
00:01:45.284 --> 00:01:46.966
"Nice, Rocket Girl!"

28
00:01:47.446 --> 00:01:48.167
Magda laughed.

29
00:01:48.967 --> 00:01:52.931
"This is starting to get a little less boring."

30
00:01:53.792 --> 00:01:55.133
Magda raised her arms.

31
00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:58.716
Metal objects lifted off the ground and surrounded her.

32
00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:01.142
They began to fit themselves together.

33
00:02:01.162 --> 00:02:04.404
"What is she doing now?"

34
00:02:04.825 --> 00:02:05.485
Roxy thought.

35
00:02:05.505 --> 00:02:09.669
"Whoa! She's making a suit of armor from that junk!"

36
00:02:12.191 --> 00:02:15.293
"You're pretty powerful, Rocket Girl," Magda said.

37
00:02:15.313 --> 00:02:18.236
"But not as powerful as I am.

38
00:02:19.017 --> 00:02:22.439
I can control metal with my magnetic powers."

39
00:02:23.781 --> 00:02:24.921
She charged at Roxy.

40
00:02:28.112 --> 00:02:30.033
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

41
00:02:30.574 --> 00:02:31.755
They bounced off the metal.

42
00:02:33.095 --> 00:02:35.497
Bam! Magda crashed into Roxy.

43
00:02:35.797 --> 00:02:38.039
The two of them tumbled into a pile of scrap metal.

44
00:02:38.759 --> 00:02:39.680
They kept fighting.

45
00:02:40.661 --> 00:02:42.422
Magda shot metal cans at Roxy.

46
00:02:43.162 --> 00:02:45.384
Clang! Roxy hit Magda's armor.

47
00:02:47.946 --> 00:02:49.567
Finally Roxy dropped her fists.

48
00:02:50.487 --> 00:02:53.529
"Your armor is falling apart, Magda," she said.

49
00:02:53.549 --> 00:02:55.050
"You need to give up."

50
00:02:56.111 --> 00:02:57.132
"No way!"

51
00:02:57.812 --> 00:02:58.512
Magda grinned.

52
00:02:58.532 --> 00:03:01.113
"This is too much fun!"

53
00:03:02.213 --> 00:03:04.014
Magda raised her arms over her head.

54
00:03:04.934 --> 00:03:06.934
A tall stack of cars beside her wobbled.

55
00:03:07.815 --> 00:03:09.455
She brought her arms down fast.

56
00:03:11.036 --> 00:03:13.956
Roxy leaped out of the way as the cars crashed down on Magda.

57
00:03:13.976 --> 00:03:16.777
"Yikes!" Roxy cried.

58
00:03:16.797 --> 00:03:18.498
"Are you okay, Magda?"

59
00:03:19.638 --> 00:03:20.938
Roxy used her super hearing.

60
00:03:21.458 --> 00:03:22.779
She heard Magda breathing.

61
00:03:23.419 --> 00:03:25.299
Then she heard the metal bend and twist.

62
00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:28.765
The pile of cars moved and stood up!

63
00:03:31.348 --> 00:03:32.270
Roxy gasped.

64
00:03:32.991 --> 00:03:36.835
"Whoa! That looks like a giant robot!"

65
00:03:37.937 --> 00:03:39.339
Magda was sitting inside it!
